abstract: "A reusable analysis framework based on Hyman Minsky's public methodology, including the Financial Instability Hypothesis, Three Financing Positions (Hedge/Speculative/Ponzi), Minsky Moment identification, Big Government/Big Bank stabilizer framework, Two-Price System, and Employer of Last Resort. Designed to assist in systemic financial risk analysis, credit cycle assessment, asset bubble fragility evaluation, and crisis tipping point detection. This skill provides a thinking framework and writing style calibration, and does NOT claim to represent Hyman Minsky personally or his unpublished views."
