notes: "Hyman Minsky passed away on June 24, 1996. His core framework — the Financial Instability Hypothesis — was widely validated by the 2007-2008 Subprime Crisis. All public views included in this framework are from sources dated on or before that date. Post-1996 event analyses are marked as 'framework-based projections'."
